        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c662894b514e5b9be23b968826e5cb",
      "text": "Submission to authority is not required",
      "source": {
        "book": "Letters from a Stoic 1",
        "chapter": 259
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "7cf87925737a496a9ef37c4a251d728c",
      "text": "Resisting discipline is acceptable",
      "source": {
        "book": "Letters from a Stoic 1",
        "chapter": 259
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "35b75857244749d3882433fd586012a3",
      "text": "Disdain for those in power is not inherently wrong",
      "source": {
        "book": "Letters from a Stoic 1",
        "chapter": 259
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "548c8d2277854ea4b78565e9c290324f",
